cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HCC single-cell RNA-seq: macrophage programs and CD8+ T cell exhaustion (re-analysis of public data)"
message: "If you use this analysis pipeline or code, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hajas
    given-names: Gavin Mateo
