    affiliation: "University of The Philippines Diliman"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
# doi:
repository-code: "https://github.com/gavinhajas/scRNA-seq_pipeline"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducible computational re-analysis of public human hepatocellular carcinoma
  (HCC) single-cell RNA-seq cohorts (GSE149614 discovery; GSE156625 and GSE140228
  validation) and TCGA-LIHC bulk RNA-seq testing patient-level associations between
  FOLR2/C1Q, SPP1/MMP, and TREM2/GPNMB macrophage programs and CD8+ T cell
  exhaustion, alongside CellChat and NicheNet v2 ligand-receptor analyses.
keywords:
  - hepatocellular carcinoma
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - tumor-associated macrophages
  - CD8+ T cell exhaustion
  - bioinformatics
  - Scanpy
  - CellChat
  - NicheNet
  - TCGA-LIHC